---
description: Drive and verify an iOS simulator with CosmoKit
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use `cosmokit doctor` and then `cosmokit agent start` before driving an iOS
app. Read `cosmokit ui tree --mode act` first, decide using refs, perform one
action such as `ui tap <ref>` or `ui type`, and read one fresh tree afterward.
Prefer refs over coordinates, `act` over `debug`, and `--max` for long screens.
Use a screenshot only when visual layout matters. On `refStale`, take a new
tree; on `driverUnavailable`, start the agent; if the keyboard is not up, tap
the field first. Stop with `cosmokit agent stop`.
